OL,3,CPrincess Eugenie gives birth to baby
OL,4,Cgirl in Portugal
OL,6,FPrincess Eugenie and her husband Jack
OL,7,FBrooksbank have welcomed their third
OL,8,Fchild - a daughter.
OL,10,FThe baby girl, who the couple have not
OL,11,Fyet named, was born on Monday at
OL,12,F6.20pm at a hospital in Lisbon,
OL,13,FPortugal, weighing 6lb 9oz, Buckingham
OL,14,FPalace said, and mother and baby are
OL,15,Fsaid to be doing well.
OL,17,FThe princess shared the good news on
OL,18,FInstagram, saying: "Jack and I are so
OL,19,Fexcited to announce Baby Girl
OL,20,FBrooksbank!! We are beyond in love
OL,21,Fwith our girlie."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/3
