OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785872169
OL,3,CPrincess Eugenie gives birth to baby
OL,4,Cgirl in Portugal
OL,6,FThe birth is a rare occasion where a
OL,7,Fmember of the royal family has been
OL,8,Fborn overseas, with Eugenie and Mr
OL,9,FBrooksbank having a home and other
OL,10,Fconnections in Portugal.
OL,12,FPrincess Eugenie is the youngest
OL,13,Fdaughter of Andrew Mountbatten-Windsor
OL,14,Fand Sarah Ferguson, and her uncle is
OL,15,FKing Charles III.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
