PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785872169
OL,3,CPrincess Eugenie gives birth to baby
OL,4,Cgirl in Portugal
OL,6,FIn a statement, Buckingham Palace
OL,7,Fsaid: "Their Majesties The King and
OL,8,FQueen and other members of The Royal
OL,9,FFamily were delighted to be informed
OL,10,Fof the news."
OL,12,FEugenie and Mr Brooksbank have two
OL,13,Fsons called August, aged five, and
OL,14,FErnest, aged three.
OL,16,FThe Palace added that Princess Eugenie
OL,17,Fand Mr Brooksbank are deeply grateful
OL,18,Fto the hospital staff for their care.
OL,20,FThey have not yet decided a name for
OL,21,Ftheir latest addition.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/3
